                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Disclaimer: Was given a free copy by the developer.\n\nOk, so tl:dr, I recommend it, because its cool and your biceps will get an awesome workout.\n\nPositives\nYou get to throw fireballs, IN SPACE!\nIt's kind of like breakout or arkanoid, except in VR with giant fireballs from both hands. \nBeating all 60 levels will work your arms like you won't believe and It's pretty fun. \n\nCons\nNot a whole lot of \"meat\" to the game yet, but it's early access, so hopefully that's coming. \nThe game mechanic in it's current form is kind of simplistic, but again, early access so hopefully thats also on the way.\n\nIn either case, $5 is cheaper than lunch and this game will help you burn that off, have a good one!",
